WEBVTT

00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:31.170
the solution literally walked
in front of me.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:37.593
A herd of more than 100 goats
crossed my path.

00:01:38.302 --> 00:01:39.887
And I thought to myself,

00:01:39.887 --> 00:01:42.390
that is a lot of goats.

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:43.391
(Laughter)

00:01:45.143 --> 00:01:50.022
I took a chance and asked
the village elder:

00:01:50.022 --> 00:01:54.485
Would they consider paying me
for their pump in goats?

00:01:54.986 --> 00:01:56.487
He agreed,

00:01:56.487 --> 00:02:00.533
and that is how Pathan Goth got its pump